  "scheduleNotes": {
    "format": "list",
    "notes": [
      "Water removal is rated in pints / gallons per day at the conditions listed.",
      "Unit ships with a factory power cord and NEMA 5-15 plug. Electrical contractor to provide a 115V receptacle within reach of the cord.",
      "Contractor to route condensate by gravity from the unit's 3/4\" drain connection to an approved drain. Provide a condensate pump where gravity drainage is not available.",
      "Dimensions and weights include duct collars.",
      "Install per the manufacturer's instructions. Keep the filter and controls accessible for service.",
      "Compact70: Horizontal unit sized to hang between floor joists. Rotatable discharge for horizontal or vertical discharge. Auto restart after a power outage.",
      "Oasis105: Variable speed fan (Low / High / Auto). Optional supply duct kit for ducted installs. Positive pressure drain, no P-trap required. Dedicated float switch port.",
      "Advance Dry110: Dual exhaust outlets. Terminal block for SmartAire remote sensor and float switch. Built-in P-trap. Dew point cut-out.",
      "Classic: Vertical basement unit. Minimum operating temperature 56°F. Optional duct kit and condensate pump.",
      "Ultra MD33: In-wall unit, 5-3/4\" deep, for 2x6 or 2x4 stud walls. Plug-in or hard-wired on a 15A circuit. Drain to hub drain or plumbing line. Built-in digital dehumidistat and washable filter. Optional kits: surface mount (4037766), 2x4 wall mount bezel (4037767), rear panel (4037768).",
      "Ultra70: 8\" round inlet and outlet with optional 8\" outdoor air ventilation duct. Terminal block for optional DEH 3000/R controller. 15A circuit.",
      "Ultra V100 / V125 / V155 / V205: Built-in 8\" outdoor air ventilation inlet (meets ASHRAE 62.2). Duct connections: 8\" and 10\" round inlets, 10\" round outlet. 15A dedicated circuit. 24VAC terminal block for DEH 3000/R control. SmartAire remote sensor and power damper (V100 / V125 / V155). Secondary drain port for float switch. Amps listed at 104°F / 36% RH."
    ]
  },
